The Apple Sales Coach app will begin using AI-generated video presenters to deliver personalized training content to retail salespeople around the world.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/02/Apple-Sales-Coach-App.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="900" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1036364" /><br/>
In a new video message, an Apple trainer said that the update addresses a limitation of traditional training programs: the impossibility of creating truly individualized content for hundreds of thousands of salespeople across different markets, languages, and product focuses. Apple said it will now use AI to generate short, focused videos tailored to the products a seller works with, the skills they are developing, and the language they speak.<br/>
<br/>
